# Vite production build values — PUBLIC BY DESIGN.
#
# These are baked into the browser bundle at Docker build time:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL               — your Supabase project URL (public)
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY  — the Supabase anon/publishable key
#
# The anon key is designed to be exposed in browsers; it is NOT a secret.
# Server-side secrets (SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET) live in Render environment
# variables, never here.

